{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0103_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2ca79dbe0c92bf8e76025dc2b59e3000ff8260fe3b67a4ec04d44ffb74f70f58", "ja": "（「Bonnes! Bonnes!! Vacances!!!」が\n好評なため、PVを撮影する事になった）", "zh": "（『Bonnes! Bonnes!! Vacances!!!』大获好评，\n决定拍摄PV了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0103_1001_p", "source_sha256": "408fa284b7c85517c5b3c744547915cac858a4c7577474dfefd0e609e72b7ab6", "ja": "（メンバーはもちろんリブラの3人。\nそして、場所は……）", "zh": "（成员当然是『天秤座』的三个人，\n地点则是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0103_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "1e3605ec21430e31c46c44d4c5f8c70ebec17970e53babe1376cd490a6409dc7", "ja": "{$P$}、着替え終わったよー！\n美奈子と翼も、もうすこししたら来るって。", "zh": "{$P$}，我换好衣服啰──！\n美奈子跟翼说马上就会过来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0103_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "e4396f976f8305495d3fb0ba4cd26b63fed4d4ff218ca58f6cf9f60c9cc0a125", "ja": "それにしても……この場所に、こんなに早く\n戻ってこられるなんて、夢にも思わなかったよ～！", "zh": "话说回来……我做梦都没有想到，\n居然能这么快就回到这个地方～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0103_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "e8071406a484626f43db4ccb301f474674d00faa84fa2ab0e717a397a5bfbd67", "ja": "{$P$}！\n今回も、思いっきり楽しもうね♪", "zh": "{$P$}！\n这次也让我们尽情享受吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0103_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6387d63b2b01fffe66dac0599a3f767e8e09c86f5dc2eea09dd88ab96149ecfc", "ja": "のり子、今回はバカンスじゃなくて仕事だ。\n遊びで来てるんじゃないんだぞ？", "zh": "法子，这次是来工作，不是来度假的。\n我们可不是来玩的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0103_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "825810912f1c8d4d5a5646e716516edb255546305d0be195f0cc445496158603", "ja": "も～、それくらいわかってるってば♪\nまずはアタシ達のPV撮影、でしょ？", "zh": "真是的～这点小事我知道啦♪\n首先要拍摄我们的PV，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0103_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "d18aa78402f2b838961768bbf1f742e4276b9af25e7c5bc292ccb63cabaccae9", "ja": "あの曲のおかげで、また来られたんだもん。\n感謝の気持ちをこめて、最高のPVにしないとだよね！", "zh": "谁叫我们是托那首歌的福，才能再次来到这里呢。\n必须怀着感谢的心情拍出最棒的PV才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0103_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "6395895ad54c4d899df52f78a9217621d6a318a8e5b72109e7091c90cad65b4a", "ja": "でもさ、せっかくバカンスの歌なんだし。\nすこしくらいは楽しまないと……ねっ？", "zh": "不过，这毕竟是一首关于假期的歌嘛。\n如果不稍微享受一下怎么行……对不对？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0103_1009_p", "source_sha256": "159eec7a490d7351d86c42c3993e6d9bfb145cb455908857b04ae819d6daa460", "ja": "仕方がないな……。\nでも、撮影が終わってからだぞ。", "zh": "真拿你没办法……\n但要等拍摄结束后喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0103_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "2c10c3c0e523bd4f351d8a2ee0f46a58f7651a89ace0cc942b950efaebbf3d05", "ja": "はーい！　ありがと、{$P$}！\n今のアタシは、気合い十分だからね！", "zh": "好的──！谢啦，{$P$}！\n现在的我可是干劲十足！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0103_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "5109a01530051bfdf598518d705ad0022bfbe01ef00cc10762b56110d2b5f373", "ja": "砂浜ダッシュだって遠泳だって、\nどんなアクションでもこなしてみせるっ！", "zh": "不管是要沙滩冲刺，还是要长泳，\n任何动作我都一定能完成！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0103_1012_p", "source_sha256": "a2bd59a4369c9279a385849fa963cb2893d2cf4eeef2d1224a10785b7ef13bc5", "ja": "いや、普通でいいんだけど……でも、本当に\n気合いが入ってるな。何かやりたい事でもあるのか？", "zh": "不用了，普通点就可以了……不过，你真的很有干劲呢。\n是有什么想要做的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0103_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "728816b7cd37aecec880ad92500c5a0830e1caadf3fe5a7cdcbe2e19ab99389c", "ja": "そうなんだ！　この前来たときには、\nやれなかったことがまだいっぱいあって……。", "zh": "就是这样！上次来这里的时候，\n还有好多事情没有体验过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0103_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "e359f6a2a5df47cf22aff9a6eaf311d30b942af667fd2bddbee0bc60332f6cbc", "ja": "せっかくまたリブラの3人で来られたんだから、\n思い残すことがないようにしなきゃーって！", "zh": "难得『天秤座』三个人又一起来这里，\n可不能留下半点遗憾！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0103_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b4336a32b3a452e8119b57d040530b9fafa3ecbad53bb9adace3768dc83b6557", "ja": "みんなの思い出の場所だし……もしかしたら、\n新しい歌詞が浮かんだりするかもしれないな。", "zh": "毕竟这个地方充满大家的回忆……\n也许你们还能想出新的歌词呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0103_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "bcd01bbea09c2e28c5daafe46528e4185768b7f245915588020cdf9f3ffa43fa", "ja": "あはっ、そうかも！　今回は、すっごく元気な歌\nだったから～……次は、ロマンチック系でどうかな？", "zh": "啊哈，说不定呢！这次是首充满活力的歌，\n所以……下次换成浪漫风格的怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0103_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "7319bc8a4171170615c17021783992df3d797ce0b7559abfe051da92688045eb", "ja": "水上ヴィラで、3人で星空を見たでしょ？\nああいう感じで……えへへっ。", "zh": "我们三个人不是在水上别墅一起眺望过星空吗？\n就像那种感觉……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0103_1018_p", "source_sha256": "453be3d4d65481e2f534f6101aff41c0383754c3fc046707041cef4981c353a9", "ja": "お、いいんじゃないか？\nのり子のロマンチックな歌詞、楽しみにしてるよ！", "zh": "哦，挺不错的啊。\n我很期待法子写出的浪漫歌词！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0103_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "28f60c5db7dd28b891dc7e3931fc42a505eaf17ca051ccd569b152fae2a1c3d4", "ja": "え、えええええっ！？\nアタシ、書くなんて言ってないよー！？", "zh": "什、什么────！？\n我没有说我要写啊──！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0103_1020_p", "source_sha256": "45e32a417ac4d03507fffd08994afbe95c6fedf112680b0ad055e06bf909a8bb", "ja": "あれ、そうなのか？\nてっきりのり子が書くんだと思った。", "zh": "咦？是这样吗？\n我还以为是法子你要写。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0103_1021_043nor", "source_sha256": "915054a62d24b610b34c9ff31110b75275642fdf8a158b31ab5b5db2444c858e", "ja": "か、書かない書かない！　ていうかムリ！\nううっ、恥ずかしい……。", "zh": "我、我不会写啦！应该说，不可能！\n呜呜，好丢脸……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0103_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "f786583de108b41c17b90f4147ccd99c3a8c0c67fe3b66ef73c28349a3648fe7", "ja": "え、ええと……美奈子と翼、着替え終わったかな？\nアタシ、迎えに行ってくるっ！", "zh": "那、那个……美奈子跟翼换好衣服了吧？\n我去接她们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0103_1023_p", "source_sha256": "db649546e9689bb327dc503f4450257c6f4afb4bdf1891997dae9dd027ddef5c", "ja": "あっ、のり子……行っちゃったか。", "zh": "啊，法子……走掉了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0103_1024_p", "source_sha256": "68b30cb5e5702a3a5c9e3387e176586654cc026563f6eff6ab719f2e5b328c55", "ja": "（慌ただしくもあるが、楽しく元気に……\nそんな魅力に溢れた、PV撮影になりそうだな！）", "zh": "（忙乱之中又开心有活力……\n似乎能拍摄出充满这种魅力的PV！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
